 with AD personalization on and  this is opted out it's a big improvement  there the the actual the real the real  improvement is that the flag has been  changed from true to false but the data  is increased and it's still being same  so yeah it's so you can't really opt out  then so your best bet well an audience  like this has probably got its one  advantage you've probably got if you've  got an Android phone is probably rooted  so you could always just block graft at  facebook.com/ I don't know what the what  the implications of that might be there  might be other stuff that just stops  working but but most users don't have  rooted phones and so you only other real  alternative is you could try no install  apps that use the Facebook SDK but good  luck working out which ones those are  because it's not well indicated on any  app I've ever seen so the only other  options you have is to minimize what  your the datee or your same thing so you  could segregate your apps have a  different profile in your Android device  for every app so that the yeah the  advertising IDs are separate and then  you you know your your ID will only  apply to that one out and obviously you  can always reset your ID and opt out it  doesn't really match but it does at  least you know it keeps your profile  fresh keeps the you know it's the time  frame that also makes quite a big  difference to how you are profiled  so but why should you have to do all of  this so I'm going to release all of my  environment you so anyone can we  replicate we've done I'm gonna do that  tomorrow because I need to get home and  sleep but so yeah I mean my environment  is going to go on the PI's website and  then all of our documentation is also  available on PI's website so if anyone  else wants to look through what all of  the apps we looked at don't do I  definitely suggest you have a look at  kayak and I just have a look at the LED  flashlight it's quite interesting  especially their consent slows but yeah  w